874
00:28:51,390 --> 00:28:52,857
a real emergency fund,

875
00:28:52,857 --> 00:28:54,125
or start investing.

876
00:28:54,305 --> 00:28:56,139
The poverty premium is real.

877
00:28:56,319 --> 00:28:57,568
And for many people,

878
00:28:57,568 --> 00:28:59,941
