886
00:29:14,607 --> 00:29:16,575
Tanya, still paying the premium,

887
00:29:16,575 --> 00:29:18,420
is in a similar place to where

888
00:29:18,420 --> 00:29:20,818
she started, through no lack of effort.

889
00:29:20,998 --> 00:29:23,309
Then a coworker tells Tanya about the

890
00:29:23,309 --> 00:29:24,121
credit union.

891
00:29:24,301 --> 00:29:25,310
Within a year,

892
00:29:25,310 --> 00:29:27,615
her fees drop to almost nothing,

893
00:29:27,615 --> 00:29:29,561
