898
00:29:37,457 --> 00:29:39,802
Maria heard about a better option first.

899
00:29:39,982 --> 00:29:41,968
That's why sharing what you learn matters.

900
00:29:42,148 --> 00:29:44,193
Someone you know might be paying the

901
00:29:44,193 --> 00:29:45,670
