Question two.

917
00:30:15,333 --> 00:30:17,249
Are payday loans ever okay?

918
00:30:17,429 --> 00:30:19,538
They're one of the most expensive options

919
00:30:19,538 --> 00:30:20,053
available.

920
00:30:20,233 --> 00:30:21,319
Before using one,

921
00:30:21,319 --> 00:30:23,938
call creditors, ask your employer about a

922
00:30:23,938 --> 00:30:27,325
paycheck advance, look for credit union alternatives,

923
00:30:27,325 --> 00:30:30,008
and check local assistance through two one

924
00:30:30,008 --> 00:30:30,264
one.

925
00:30:30,444 --> 00:30:31,536
If you do use one,

926
00:30:31,536 --> 00:30:33,295
