952
00:31:18,844 --> 00:31:21,000
Protect housing, utilities,

953
00:31:21,000 --> 00:31:24,033
food and transportation to work first.

954
00:31:24,213 --> 00:31:25,860
Then call each creditor,

955
00:31:25,860 --> 00:31:28,329
